    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a daring 19th-century explorer and journey to <i>The Lost World</i> \u2014 a prehistoric plateau hidden beyond the mists of civilization. Inspired by the classic novel by Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, this immersive VR experience plunges you into a realm where ancient beasts roam free and survival is anything but guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of an elite scientific expedition, you'll face more than just the unknown: you'll confront tooth and claw, unravel long-buried mysteries, and make impossible choices between discovery and self-preservation. Every trek into the jungle could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No modern weapons. No second chances. Only your skill, your nerve, and your knowledge of the natural world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 <strong>True-to-life Dinosaur Encounters</strong>: Stalk and study creatures brought to life with realistic behavior and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Exploration Meets Survival</strong>: Traverse treacherous terrain, decipher ancient markings, and uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9 <strong>Victorian Expedition Gear</strong>: Use era-authentic tools, from single-shot rifles to field journals and specimen kits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Immersive VR Design</strong>: Interact with your surroundings naturally \u2014 climb, track, aim, and survive using your own movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0b <strong>Dynamic Environments</strong>: Weather, time of day, and ecosystem behaviors evolve with your choices and progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you seek glory, science, or survival? In <i>The Lost World</i>, only one may be possible.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a daring 19th-century explorer and journey to <i>The Lost World</i> \u2014 a prehistoric plateau hidden beyond the mists of civilization. Inspired by the classic novel by Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, this immersive VR experience plunges you into a realm where ancient beasts roam free and survival is anything but guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of an elite scientific expedition, you'll face more than just the unknown: you'll confront tooth and claw, unravel long-buried mysteries, and make impossible choices between discovery and self-preservation. Every trek into the jungle could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No modern weapons. No second chances. Only your skill, your nerve, and your knowledge of the natural world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 <strong>True-to-life Dinosaur Encounters</strong>: Stalk and study creatures brought to life with realistic behavior and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Exploration Meets Survival</strong>: Traverse treacherous terrain, decipher ancient markings, and uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9 <strong>Victorian Expedition Gear</strong>: Use era-authentic tools, from single-shot rifles to field journals and specimen kits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Immersive VR Design</strong>: Interact with your surroundings naturally \u2014 climb, track, aim, and survive using your own movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0b <strong>Dynamic Environments</strong>: Weather, time of day, and ecosystem behaviors evolve with your choices and progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you seek glory, science, or survival? In <i>The Lost World</i>, only one may be possible.</strong></p>",
